# Not needed by any image stage (builder does `COPY . .`, so everything here
# would otherwise be sent to the build context and bust the build cache).
# Kept IN the context on purpose: src/, public/, prisma/, scripts/ (tsconfig's
# "**/*.ts" typechecks them during `next build`), docker/ (entrypoints),
# package*.json, tsconfig.json, next.config.ts, postcss.config.mjs,
# prisma.config.ts, eslint.config.mjs.
